# Deploy every change

After any code or docs change the user asked for, commit it, push to GitHub `main`, and let Railway deploy. Do not wait to be asked.

Never commit `.env`, `.env.local`, resumes, tokens, or database files.

Railway project: `ai-recruiter-platform`. GitHub: `Saket0626/ai-recruiter-platform`. The `web` service deploys from `main`.
